  "solution": {
    "text": "Rearranging all the equations, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />For a non-trivial solution,<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math>"
